Package: maluos-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), casper, initramfs-tools, plymouth, plymouth-theme-spinner, maluos-branding (>= 0.4.0), mokutil, iproute2, squashfs-tools
Description: MaluOS installer (the live medium's own)
 The installer the MaluOS medium boots into (Phase 11). This version is
 the live environment's stub: it owns the console, prints the banner and
 the medium's facts (the images, their checksums, the kernel and initrd,
 the firmware, the network) and leaves a shell; the engine, the unattended
 plan and the screens come in the next slices under the same name. The
 package also carries the live configuration: casper.conf (the live user
 maluos), the console units, the on-media apt source. It is never
 installed on a target.
